# Bad unicode escapes.
mode: syntax
---- query
'\u{110000}' '\uABCD'
---- expected
STRING@0..12 "'\\u{110000}'"
WHITESPACE@12..13 " "
STRING@13..21 "'\\uABCD'"
WHITESPACE@21..22 "\n"

error[DS0005]: invalid unicode escape `\u{110000}`
  --> query:1:2
  |
1 | '\u{110000}' '\uABCD'
  |  ^^^^^^^^^^ not a valid unicode escape
  |
  = help: write `\u{` followed by 1 to 6 hex digits and `}`, e.g. `\u{1F600}`

error[DS0005]: invalid unicode escape `\u`
  --> query:1:15
  |
1 | '\u{110000}' '\uABCD'
  |               ^^ not a valid unicode escape
  |
  = help: write `\u{` followed by 1 to 6 hex digits and `}`, e.g. `\u{1F600}`
